          <p class="hp-pub-meta">Coughlan, M., ..., Pinto, V., et al. — Space Weather · <a href="https://doi.org/10.1029/2025SW004391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="hp-pub-item">
        <span class="hp-pub-year">2025</span>
